    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Uniquely situated 4 bed elevated traditional residence with modern studio and stone outbuilding on c. 14 acre hillside plot. Featuring a character interior, patios, decks, mature woodlands and stream. Commanding panoramic coastal views the property is c. 4 miles from the harbour village of Adrigole on the scenic Beara peninsula.\r\nServices: Oil fired central heating, private water and drainage, broadband"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Rooms",
        "SortOrder": 2,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall - 3.6m x 3.0m \r\nParquet floor, staircase\r\n\r\nKitchen - 4.6m x 3.0m \r\nTiled floor, wooden kitchen and worktop, electric oven, gas hob, fridge, freezer, integrated dishwasher, steps up to sitting room, garden and patio views\r\n\r\nSitting Room - 6.8m x 5.5m \r\nParquet floor, solid fuel stove, shelving, panel ceiling\r\n\r\nInner Hall - 4.5m x 1.1m \r\nParquet floor, steps up to first floor, down to ground floor, panel ceiling\r\n\r\nLounge/Bedroom 1 - 5.4m x 4.2m \r\nParquet floor, storage, open fireplace, panoramic coastal views\r\n\r\nBathroom - 2.4m x 1.8m \r\nTiled, bath, wash hand basin, w.c. heated towel rail\r\n\r\nUtility Room - 3.2m x 3.2m \r\nTiled floor, storage, washing machine, dryer, panel ceiling\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 - 4.2m x 3.6m \r\nOpen fireplace, glass door to patio\r\n\r\nStore - 3.6m x 1.4m \r\n\r\n\r\nLanding - 6.0m x 1.1m \r\nWooden floor, hotpress\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 - 6.5m x 4.0m \r\nWooden floor, raised ceiling, panoramic coastal views from large window\r\n\r\nBedroom 4 - 4.4m x 3.3m \r\nWooden floor, countryside views\r\n\r\nBathroom 2 - 3.0m x 1.8m \r\nWooden floor, bath, wash hand basin, w.c.\r\n\r\nStudio - 7.0m x 4.0m \r\n7.0 x 2.0 covered porch\r\n\r\nStone Outbuilding - 9.0m x 6.0m \r\n\r\n\r\n"
      },
